# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLONE / DERIVATIVE REPO (Paliddo86/fusion-bridge-mcp) - LOCAL ADDITIONS.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This clone keeps the SOURCE that is needed to build, deploy and configure the
# bridge on macOS. Marketing media, demo recordings, screenshots and the visual
# assets that live on the upstream wiki stay OUT of the GitHub backup: the
# upstream release page already serves them and they were ~177 MB of the 210 MB
# checkout. The canonical media host is the wiki, exactly as upstream intends.

# --- demo recordings and their capture artifacts ---
demo/
*.webm

# --- root marketing media (hero art, feature stills, demo clips) ---
# NOTE: video *sources* for the docs live under docs/ and stay versioned.
/AdomBasicParts-138-library.mp4
/library-3d-demo.mp4
/library-3d-montage.mp4
/library-demo-live.mp4
/library-demo.mp4
/library2-3d-montage.mp4
/arch.png
/bridges-hero.png
/fusion-hero.png
/fusion-hero-new.png
/hero.png
/hero-billboard.png
/hero-billboard-v*.png
/outcomes.png
/verbs.png
/fz-*.png
/lib-*.png
/lib2-*.png
/lib3-*.png
/prefs-*.png
/pub-*.png
/step-colorize-*.png

# --- screenshot gallery (served from the wiki release page) ---
/screenshots/

# --- example media, not source ---
examples/**/*.png
examples/**/*.mp4
examples/**/*.webm

# --- docs media: keep the markdown, drop the heavy binaries ---
docs/**/*.mp4
docs/**/*.webm
docs/**/*.jpg
docs/**/*.jpeg

# --- accidental local artifacts ---
.DS_Store
*.log

